<section id="process" class="section-padding bg-gray-50">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">How It Works</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">From consultation to ongoing support — a proven process for your private AI infrastructure.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4 relative">
      <div class="hidden md:block absolute top-12 left-[10%] right-[10%] h-0.5 bg-indigo-100 -z-10"></div>
      <div class="card text-center"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 text-sm">1</span><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Consultation</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">We analyze your business needs, current workflow, and recommend the ideal AI setup.</p></div>
      <div class="card text-center"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 text-sm">2</span><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Design</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Hardware specification, software stack selection, and integration architecture tailored to you.</p></div>
      <div class="card text-center"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 text-sm">3</span><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Deploy</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Assembly, Linux, Docker, AI models, agents, security configuration — all on-site.</p></div>
      <div class="card text-center"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 text-sm">4</span><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Train</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Hands-on employee training. Custom documentation and best practices for your team.</p></div>
      <div class="card text-center"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 text-sm">5</span><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Support</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Remote monitoring, updates, model optimization, and ongoing maintenance contract.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>